<%# The price text of a book card: "from €X" (the lowest price) when the book has several copies at different prices and the cart button only chooses (b.buy = { choose: true, from }, lib/cardCart.js), else the price. Params: price, buy. The same rule as UmasUI.cardPrice in public/ui.js. Included with .trim(). -%><%= (typeof buy !== 'undefined' && buy && buy.choose && buy.from > 0) ? tr('from {price}', 'dès {price}', { price: eur(buy.from) }) : eur(price) %>